<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.51.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.51.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.51.0 (2026-11-25): Final measurements of the six objectives, guide story and review story Done. Every figure was measured on 2026-11-25 from the live files of the final decks 4.5.0 and 4.4.0 and pages 9.25.0 and 9.26.0."""@en .

ex:Obs3_Obj11_TracedExamples a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_TracedExamples ; backlog:observedValue 27 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 37 NOT reached. Counted from the book field of the two source files (ch10 source 1.3.0, ch11 source 1.4.0): chapter 10 17 of 18, chapter 11 10 of 19. The other 10 carry a named reason (the book shows the subject in text or as a task but gives no code block), which the Definition of Done allows; the objective counts only traced ones. The earlier observation said 25 (15 of 18 and 10 of 19); today's count of chapter 10 is 17 of 18, and the cause of the difference was not traced."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj11_SlidePageDiffs a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_SlidePageDiffs ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 0 reached: code check 1.2.0 conditions C1 to C3 give 0 findings on chapter 10 (18 examples) and chapter 11 (19 examples) against the final decks and pages."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj11_SplitCodeSlides a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_SplitCodeSlides ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 0 reached: condition C2 of code check 1.2.0 (exactly one code box per code slide) gives 0 findings on both final decks."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj11_PageExamplesRun a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_PageExamplesRun ; backlog:observedValue 37 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 37 reached: C4 and C5 run all 18 + 19 examples; the full page tests of pages 9.25.0 and 9.26.0 passed 410 and 414 features with 0 failed."@en .
ex:Obs3_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_ReviewVerdicts ; backlog:observedValue 24 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 24 reached, unchanged since 1.26.0. The verdicts were given on decks 4.1.0 and pages 9.21.0 and 9.22.0, before the later changes (windows default, exam results, no analogies); they were not repeated. The three roles were played by the building agent, so they are not independent."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj11_NeutralTools a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj11_NeutralTools ; backlog:observedValue 3 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Target 3 reached: the source step 1.2.0, the code check 1.2.0 and the deck builder 2.9.0 each ran on both chapters, and a search of the three files finds no chapter 10 or 11 text."@en .

ex:TK11_Guide_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Every file named in 08-tooling/METHOD_GUIDE_book_code_one_source_v1_0_0.md exists (checked by listing them). Two claims without a log were found and corrected in 1.0.1: a page test time (replaced by 'several minutes') and a row length (replaced by the measured 89). 1.0.1 is the guide to use; 1.0.0 stays." .
ex:ST11_Guide backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met: a plain-words guide with no chapter text in its steps, naming what was proven on chapters 10 and 11 and what was not." .
ex:ST11_Review_And_Plan backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "The review of chapters 10 and 11 against the book and the page and the simplification plan produced the scope, goals, objectives and stories of this lineage (1.1.0 to 1.5.0); each objective now has its final measurement above." .
